nge case of amnesia easily coexist in a bizarre parallel universe, where a desperate Mitsuko is always on the run from something inexplicable, intangible, and utterly deadly. However, amid piles of fresh corpses, mounds of scorching bullet shells, and rivulets of fragrant adolescent blood, Mitsuko must fight to stay alive, before her already messed-up day becomes even stranger. But one question still remains: who or what is the enemy?","tagline":"All high school girls out there. you are a little too obnoxious so we decided to reduce your numbers."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"リアル鬼ごっこ","overview":"女子高生のミツコは、何者かに追われ、ふと気が付くと学校の教室にたどり着いていた。一方、ケイコは知らない女性にウエディングドレスに着替えさせられ、何者かに追われる。そして陸上部のいづみも迫りくる恐怖と対峙（たいじ）することとなる。","tagline":"全国のJKの皆さん　あなたたちはちょっとふてぶてしいので、数を減らすことにします。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kL5gKYiYAeMkrN2PVe7OdYDSq9s.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rch5tr1bpNyfeRJxARoU7I2a9KR.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":340176,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kL5gKYiYAeMkrN2PVe7OdYDSq9s.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kL5gKYiYAeMkrN2PVe7OdYDSq9s.jpg","language":"it","width":951,"height":1363},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kL5gKYiYAeMkrN2PVe7OdYDSq9s.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kL5gKYiYAeMkrN2PVe7OdYDSq9s.jpg","language":"it","width":951,"height":1363}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1xqQv9PoOIVX4nHlKVQELaAHyvG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1xqQv9PoOIVX4nHlKVQELaAHyvG.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1xqQv9PoOIVX4nHlKVQELaAHyvG.jpg","prev